KARBALA KE MAQTAL MEIN ARBAEEN KA MATAM HAI <br>
<br>
KARBALA MEIN AA PAHONCHI LE KE KHAAFELA ZAINAB,<br>
 KAR RAHI HAIN BHAYI KI QHABAR PAR BUKA ZAINAB,<br>
 ARBAEEN KO AAYI HAIN BANIY-E-AZA ZAINAB,<br>
 HAR TARAF FAZAON MEIN BEKASI KA AALAM HAI<br>
<br>
MUNHARIF ZAMANA HAIN FATIMA KI JAYI SE,<br>
 HO CHUKA HAIN DIL TUKDE SADMAE JUDAYI SE,<br>
 WAKHEYA ASEERI KA KEH RAHI HAIN BHAYI SE,<br>
 HAR TARAF FAZAON MEIN BEKASI KA AALAM HAI<br>
<br>
AAP KI SAKINA KO LAA SAKI NA MEIN BHAYI,<br>
 KHOON BHARE HUE KURTE MEIN USSE HOON DAFNAYI,<br>
 KHABR USKI ZINDAAN MAIEN MAIN BANA KE HOON AAYI,<br>
 HAR TARAF FAZAON MEIN BEKASI KA AALAM HAI<br>
<br>
HAIN NASHAAN RASSI KE HAYE MERE BAAZO PAR,<br>
 CHHEEN LI LAEENAON NE FARQE PAAK SE CHADAR,<br>
 KEHRAHI HAIN BHAYI SE DARD DIL KA RORO KAR,<br>
 HAR TARAF FAZAON MEIN BEKASI KA AALAM HAI<br>
<br>
TERA SAR KATA BHAIYYA MERA SAR KHULA BHAIYYA,<br>
 KHAID HOGAYI BAN MEIN AALE MUSTAFA BHAIYYA,<br>
 HUM GHAREEBAON KA KOI THA NA AASRA BHAIYYA,<br>
 HAR TARAF FAZAON MEIN BEKASI KA AALAM HAI<br>
<br>
KARWAAN NOUHAON KA TA BA KARBALA PAHONCHA,<br>
 DIL HALAYE DETA HAI AYE HASAN TERA NOUHA,<br>
 KAR RAHI HAI RORO KAR BAIN SANIYE ZEHRA,<br>
 HAR TARAF FAZAON MEIN BEKASI KA AALAM HAI...